1b:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"A successful appeal states what was denied, why the denial is wrong, what evidence supports that, and what you are asking for. A reviewer working through a stack of appeals should be able to reach the point in the first paragraph."}]
